<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Minerals Tech upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Minerals Tech upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it upgraded Minerals Technologies Inc to accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 7/8 to 34-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
